    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U02-L06-ACTIVITY-005",
      "SourceSection": "6.2: The Return of the Box",
      "SourceExcerpt": "Earlier, we learned we can make a box from a piece of paper by cutting squares of side length \\(x\\) from each corner and then folding up the sides. Let’s say we now have a piece of paper that is 8.5 inches by 14 inches. The volume \\(V\\),…",
